              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *vimānaṁ digē mundu pailaṭu mātō māṭlāḍāḍu.* — Before the plane landed, the pilot spoke to us.]"
